OL,3,GNEWSA'We've got a foot sticking out of
OL,4,Athe ceiling': Tales from Stoke's iconic
OL,5,Anightclub
OL,6,
OL,7,FEddie Skelson used to manage an iconic
OL,8,Fnightclub and remembers the time one of
OL,9,Fhis security team radioed to say there
OL,10,Fwas something he needed to see
OL,11,Furgently.
OL,13,F"Ed, we've got a foot sticking out of
OL,14,Fthe ceiling," recalled the 59-year-old,
OL,15,Fwho, at the time, thought it was a
OL,16,Fwind-up.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
