OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'We've got a foot sticking out of
OL,4,Athe ceiling': Tales from Stoke's iconic
OL,5,Anightclub
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut it turned out there really was a
OL,8,Fhuman body part poking through into the
OL,9,Fcocktail bar at The Place, as a
OL,10,Fteenager had tried to get in through an
OL,11,Fair-conditioning shaft on the roof and
OL,12,Fgot stuck.
OL,14,FPeople always tried to sneak in, he
OL,15,Fsaid, not normally because they did not
OL,16,Fwant to pay, more often because they
OL,17,Fwere drunk or had been barred.
